{"at":"2026-11-01T07:10:38.954Z","type":"result","sequence":3,"path":"/Users/pelicannurse/.t3/projects/first-person-shooter-soul-game/docs/media/build24-review1/controls.jpg","captureMs":160.44487500000105,"beforePause":{"phase":"dialog","dialog":"OPERATOR HANDBOOK\n×\nMOVE WITH PURPOSE.\nW A S D\nMove\nMOUSE\nLook\nLMB\nFire coil rifle\nRMB\nAim down sights\nR\nReload\nSHIFT\nSoul Shift / dash\nCTRL\nSprint\nSPACE\nJump\nHOLD E\nRecover nearby memory\nESC\nPause / release mouse\n\nSoul Shift protects briefly. Dash within 4.5 m of a charging enemy to cancel its shot and stagger it for 0.8 s. A blue emitter flash confirms the break. Dashing toward a charge stops early on a successful break so you can follow up. Sideways dodges retain full travel. It deals no damage; the 4.5 s cooldown still applies. Your shield regenerates when you avoid damage.\n\nTHREAT VISOR · ◇ Sentinel / △ Interceptor / □ Warden. ! charging, · recent fire, + recent hit. Small cues sit beside visible optics; edge arrows show bearings, with counts for nearby matching threats. The centered lower readout identifies one eligible target near your view center. Cues require a clear optic and expire; they do not mark every enemy.\n\nUNDERSTOOD\n↗"},"after":{"phase":"dialog","dialog":"OPERATOR HANDBOOK\n×\nMOVE WITH PURPOSE.\nW A S D\nMove\nMOUSE\nLook\nLMB\nFire coil rifle\nRMB\nAim down sights\nR\nReload\nSHIFT\nSoul Shift / dash\nCTRL\nSprint\nSPACE\nJump\nHOLD E\nRecover nearby memory\nESC\nPause / release mouse\n\nSoul Shift protects briefly. Dash within 4.5 m of a charging enemy to cancel its shot and stagger it for 0.8 s. A blue emitter flash confirms the break. Dashing toward a charge stops early on a successful break so you can follow up. Sideways dodges retain full travel. It deals no damage; the 4.5 s cooldown still applies. Your shield regenerates when you avoid damage.\n\nTHREAT VISOR · ◇ Sentinel / △ Interceptor / □ Warden. ! charging, · recent fire, + recent hit. Small cues sit beside visible optics; edge arrows show bearings, with counts for nearby matching threats. The centered lower readout identifies one eligible target near your view center. Cues require a clear optic and expire; they do not mark every enemy.\n\nUNDERSTOOD\n↗"},"clientMs":260.1125409999986,"pageErrors":[]}
